    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c04a8855722e215f28ff155d",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "前英里王训练员",
      "source_fingerprint": "b0bb78423b35933f702e43213abe3d924a4dac3cbd59909d55c47d459fe74116",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1131/storytimeline_501131309.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        41,
        "name"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/41/name"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c388e013e6db807718ccc076",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "以短距离为目标或许是个好选择。\n调整方式也很接近英里，会比较轻松吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "026dd0eca23b7ceafc163c5574e5f5685584834ba7c41cbe5010e22e8f663cd7",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1131/storytimeline_501131309.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        41,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/41/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:44ef93e23a4f1c7c55fd6fbd",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "虽然还有短距离GⅠ「短途马锦标」能选，\n但时间落在夏季结束后不久让我有所顾虑。",
      "source_fingerprint": "00ecd00455bf104e81362e0fe2b08fc22d6c3ed6ba99620f7949793b31a921c9",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1131/storytimeline_501131309.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        42,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/42/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9469088de30463a4483eeb36",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "考虑到调整期间的话，我们没时间慢慢来了。\n我很担心会不会让她感到焦躁不安。",
      "source_fingerprint": "bb698cec6da9b2b2df90450021b500182c6e7ec380a794f95651b99b09a63bae",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1131/storytimeline_501131309.json",
      "json_path": [
