    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:138ffbb16c205dfc592f9bc3",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "嗯，主要目标是明年春天的「高松宫纪念」，\n你要在那之前借由实战确认一下对吧。\n放声你觉得呢？",
      "source_fingerprint": "bcaa39e2693d7f647f559dd33617e9e301e4f347371ff6573fa9f6342c8bb439",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1131/storytimeline_501131309.json",
      "json_path": [
