    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9bdd5aa60a72a85f1b6d5bb1",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "……啊，这本杂志。\n是杏目前辈的……",
      "source_fingerprint": "30136b5ef4062385a1a91060a5c1d49087ce35029f150c55d1736093bd256012",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1131/storytimeline_501131309.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        48,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/48/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0d826d27177ca221a9285348",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "我沿着放声欢呼的视线看去，\n有一本杂志的封面上写着杏目的名字。",
      "source_fingerprint": "62da83f1ae0eedd4851107292a7c0cab79072009ccec4a8221d1824f80b0e6c1",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1131/storytimeline_501131309.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        49,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/49/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6816d76a3bb005785a6ec4ab",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "放声欢呼",
