    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d84606e23171e67cdb30f7b0",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "就连在杜拜的竞赛获胜的杏目前辈，\n也难以挑战「凯旋门赏」啊。",
      "source_fingerprint": "7d55ed60b8a5046be36ea9204ebeabafffa8337f1e8737164ff29ba6dda8bee6",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
